# Local secrets, pairing identities, full-flash backups and runtime state
**/private/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/auth.json
**/wireless.json
**/wireless-pending.json
**/*-journal.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.codex/
# Generated Apple artwork and firmware containing it are never source releases
**/pet_assets.h
**/assets/generated/
**/apple-originals/
**/dist/
**/*.bin
**/*.elf
**/*.map
**/*.zip
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.heic
**/*.webp
# Local build output and dependency caches
**/build/
**/.build/
**/managed_components/
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old
**/*.app/
**/.venv/
**/*venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
